            "text": "JWT weak secret: forged admin token accepted - The session JWT verifies against the dictionary secret 'secret123'. A token forged offline with role=admin is accepted and its claims echoed back; the same request with a broken signature is refused with 401, so the endpoint does verify - against a guessable key."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "http://127.0.0.1:35527/api/me"
